### ==============================================================================
### TEST SUITE COMPLETA REST CLIENT — FIC ENGINE & HEDGING STRATEGIES
### Compatible con la extensión "REST Client" de Visual Studio Code (humao.rest-client)
### Soporte Multi-Broker (Webull OpenAPI & Alpaca Markets) + Dual DB (MongoDB & Supabase)
### Total: 44+ Endpoints REST Verificados
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3050/api/v1
@symbol = NVDA
@symbolAlpaca = AAPL
@expiration = 2026-10-16

### ==============================================================================
### SECCIÓN 0: SALUD, DOCUMENTACIÓN Y OPENAPI 3.1.0
### ==============================================================================

### 0.1 Raíz de la API y Metadatos del Sistema
GET {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 0.2 Health Check del Servidor y Estado de Servicios
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 0.3 Especificación Cruda OpenAPI 3.1.0 (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/spec.json
Content-Type: application/json

### 0.4 Documentación Interactiva Scalar (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs
Accept: text/html

### ==============================================================================
### SECCIÓN 1: AUTENTICACIÓN Y SESIONES JWT (MONGODB & SUPABASE)
### ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Registro de Inversionista en MongoDB Atlas
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "investor_qa_01",
  "email": "investor01@ficengine.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword2026!",
  "role": "INVESTOR",
  "databaseTarget": "mongodb"
}

### 1.2 Login de Inversionista en MONGODB ATLAS
# @name loginMongo
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "investor_qa_01",
  "password": "SecurePassword2026!",
  "databaseTarget": "mongodb"
}

### Variable de Token JWT MongoDB
@tokenMongo = {{loginMongo.response.body.token}}

### 1.3 Login de Inversionista en SUPABASE POSTGRESQL
# @name loginSupabase
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "investor_qa_01",
  "password": "SecurePassword2026!",
  "databaseTarget": "supabase"
}

### Variable de Token JWT Supabase
@tokenSupabase = {{loginSupabase.response.body.token}}

### 1.4 Validar Sesión Activa del Inversionista
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMongo}}

### 1.5 Cierre de Sesión (Logout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMongo}}

### ==============================================================================
### SECCIÓN 2: ACTIVOS SUBYACENTES (UNDERLYINGS) — POLÍGLOTA
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Listar Subyacentes en MONGODB ATLAS
GET {{baseUrl}}/underlyings
x-database-selection: mongodb

### 2.2 Listar Subyacentes en SUPABASE POSTGRESQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/underlyings
x-database-selection: supabase

### 2.3 Consultar Subyacente por Ticker (NVDA en MongoDB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/underlyings/symbol/NVDA
x-database-selection: mongodb

### 2.4 Consultar Subyacente por Ticker (AAPL en Supabase)
GET {{baseUrl}}/underlyings/symbol/AAPL
x-database-selection: supabase

### 2.5 Crear Subyacente Individual en MongoDB Atlas
POST {{baseUrl}}/underlyings
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: mongodb

{
  "symbol": "TSLA",
  "companyName": "Tesla Inc.",
  "spotPrice": 360.25,
  "volatility": 0.520
}

### 2.6 Crear Subyacentes en Lote (Batch Array) en MongoDB
POST {{baseUrl}}/underlyings/batch
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: mongodb

[
  {
    "symbol": "AMD",
    "companyName": "Advanced Micro Devices Inc.",
    "spotPrice": 165.40,
    "volatility": 0.440
  },
  {
    "symbol": "QCOM",
    "companyName": "Qualcomm Inc.",
    "spotPrice": 172.10,
    "volatility": 0.285
  }
]

### 2.7 Actualizar Cotización Spot y Volatilidad de un Subyacente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/underlyings/symbol/TSLA
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: mongodb

{
  "spotPrice": 368.50,
  "volatility": 0.495
}

### 2.8 Eliminar Subyacente de la Base de Datos
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/underlyings/symbol/TSLA
x-database-selection: mongodb

### ==============================================================================
### SECCIÓN 3: MOTOR CUANTITATIVO F0 (BLACK-SCHOLES & GRIEGAS)
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Valuación Analítica Black-Scholes y 5 Griegas (F0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quant/black-scholes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spotPrice": 221.30,
  "strikePrice": 200.00,
  "timeToExpirationYears": 0.08,
  "volatility": 0.48,
  "riskFreeRate": 0.045,
  "optionType": "PUT"
}

### 3.2 Volatilidad Implícita con Newton-Raphson (F0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quant/implied-volatility
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marketPrice": 2.54,
  "spotPrice": 221.30,
  "strikePrice": 200.00,
  "timeToExpirationYears": 0.08,
  "riskFreeRate": 0.045,
  "optionType": "PUT"
}

### ==============================================================================
### SECCIÓN 4: RECOMENDACIÓN Y ESTRUCTURACIÓN DE COBERTURAS (HEDGING)
### ==============================================================================

### 4.1 Recomendar Opción PUT Protectora Óptima (F0) en Webull
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging/recommend-option/NVDA?type=PUT&broker=WEBULL&moneyness=OTM

### 4.2 Recomendar Opción CALL Financiadora Óptima (F0) en Webull
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging/recommend-option/NVDA?type=CALL&broker=WEBULL&moneyness=OTM

### 4.3 Recomendar Opción PUT Protectora Óptima en Alpaca
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging/recommend-option/AAPL?type=PUT&broker=ALPACA&moneyness=OTM

### 4.4 Recomendar Opción CALL Financiadora Óptima en Alpaca
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging/recommend-option/AAPL?type=CALL&broker=ALPACA&moneyness=OTM

### 4.5 Estructurar y Crear Cobertura Protective Put en MongoDB
POST {{baseUrl}}/hedging/protective-put
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: mongodb

{
  "portfolioId": "PORT-DEMO-01",
  "broker": "WEBULL",
  "symbol": "NVDA",
  "spotPrice": 221.30,
  "sharesCount": 100,
  "putStrike": 200.00,
  "putPremium": 2.54,
  "expirationDate": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 4.6 Estructurar y Crear Zero-Cost Collar Spread en MongoDB
# @name createCollarMongo
POST {{baseUrl}}/hedging/collar-spread
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: mongodb

{
  "portfolioId": "PORT-COLLAR-01",
  "broker": "WEBULL",
  "symbol": "NVDA",
  "spotPrice": 221.30,
  "sharesCount": 100,
  "putStrike": 210.00,
  "callStrike": 230.00,
  "putPremium": 2.17,
  "callPremium": 2.38,
  "expirationDate": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Variable de ID de Estrategia Creada
@strategyIdMongo = {{createCollarMongo.response.body.data.id}}

### 4.7 Estructurar y Crear Zero-Cost Collar Spread en Supabase
# @name createCollarSupabase
POST {{baseUrl}}/hedging/collar-spread
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: supabase

{
  "portfolioId": "PORT-COLLAR-02",
  "broker": "ALPACA",
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "spotPrice": 343.85,
  "sharesCount": 100,
  "putStrike": 310.00,
  "callStrike": 360.00,
  "putPremium": 2.25,
  "callPremium": 3.00,
  "expirationDate": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Variable de ID de Estrategia Supabase
@strategyIdSupabase = {{createCollarSupabase.response.body.data.id}}

### 4.8 Auto-Collar Autónomo Todo-en-Uno (Webull - Modo Simulado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/hedging/auto-collar
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: mongodb
x-broker-selection: WEBULL

{
  "symbol": "NVDA",
  "sharesCount": 100,
  "broker": "WEBULL",
  "executeOrders": false
}

### 4.9 Auto-Collar Autónomo Todo-en-Uno (Webull - Emisión Real en Firme)
POST {{baseUrl}}/hedging/auto-collar
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: mongodb
x-broker-selection: WEBULL

{
  "symbol": "NVDA",
  "sharesCount": 100,
  "broker": "WEBULL",
  "executeOrders": true
}

### 4.10 Auto-Collar Autónomo Todo-en-Uno (Alpaca - Emisión Real en Firme)
POST {{baseUrl}}/hedging/auto-collar
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: supabase
x-broker-selection: ALPACA

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "sharesCount": 100,
  "broker": "ALPACA",
  "executeOrders": true
}

### 4.11 Listar Estrategias de Cobertura en MONGODB ATLAS
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging/strategies
x-database-selection: mongodb

### 4.12 Listar Estrategias de Cobertura en SUPABASE POSTGRESQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging/strategies
x-database-selection: supabase

### 4.13 Consultar Estrategia por ID en MongoDB
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging/strategies/{{strategyIdMongo}}
x-database-selection: mongodb

### 4.14 Actualizar Estado del Ciclo de Vida de una Estrategia
PUT {{baseUrl}}/hedging/strategies/{{strategyIdMongo}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: mongodb

{
  "status": "CLOSED"
}

### 4.15 Eliminar Estrategia por ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/hedging/strategies/{{strategyIdMongo}}
x-database-selection: mongodb

### ==============================================================================
### SECCIÓN 5: OPERACIONES CON SUBDOCUMENTOS (LEGS, UNDERLYING, METRICS & PAYOFF)
### ==============================================================================

### 5.1 Consultar Subdocumento Underlying de una Estrategia
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/underlying
x-database-selection: supabase

### 5.2 Actualizar Subdocumento Underlying
PUT {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/underlying
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: supabase

{
  "spotPriceAtEntry": 346.50,
  "sharesCount": 100
}

### 5.3 Listar Todas las Patas (Legs) de una Estrategia
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/legs
x-database-selection: supabase

### 5.4 Consultar Pata Individual por legId
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/legs/LEG-AAPL-STOCK
x-database-selection: supabase

### 5.5 Agregar una Nueva Pata (POST Subdocumento)
POST {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/legs
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: supabase

{
  "legId": "LEG-AAPL-ADDITIONAL-CALL",
  "legRole": "FINANCE_CEILING",
  "assetType": "OPTION",
  "contractSymbol": "AAPL261016C00380000",
  "optionType": "CALL",
  "strike": 380.00,
  "quantity": 1,
  "entryPrice": 2.68,
  "delta": 0.22
}

### 5.6 Actualizar Pata Individual (PUT Subdocumento)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/legs/LEG-AAPL-ADDITIONAL-CALL
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: supabase

{
  "entryPrice": 2.75,
  "delta": 0.24
}

### 5.7 Eliminar Pata Individual (DELETE Subdocumento)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/legs/LEG-AAPL-ADDITIONAL-CALL
x-database-selection: supabase

### 5.8 Consultar Subdocumento de Métricas Financieras
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/financial-metrics
x-database-selection: supabase

### 5.9 Recalcular Métricas Financieras con Nuevo Precio Spot
PUT {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/financial-metrics/recalculate
Content-Type: application/json
x-database-selection: supabase

{
  "currentSpotPrice": 350.00
}

### 5.10 Generar Matriz Discreta de Payoff (P&L) de 25 Puntos para Gráfica
GET {{baseUrl}}/hedging-strategies/{{strategyIdSupabase}}/payoff-matrix?steps=25&rangePct=0.20
x-database-selection: supabase

### ==============================================================================
### SECCIÓN 6: INTEGRACIÓN MULTI-BROKER (WEBULL OPENAPI & ALPACA MARKETS)
### ==============================================================================

### 6.1 Consultar Cuenta de Inversión en WEBULL OPENAPI (DEV4Q8EB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/account
x-broker-selection: WEBULL

### 6.2 Consultar Cuenta de Inversión en ALPACA MARKETS (Paper Trading)
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/account
x-broker-selection: ALPACA

### 6.3 Cotización Spot L1 en Tiempo Real de Webull (NVDA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/quote/NVDA
x-broker-selection: WEBULL

### 6.4 Cotización Spot L1 en Tiempo Real de Alpaca (AAPL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/quote/AAPL
x-broker-selection: ALPACA

### 6.5 Cadena de Opciones en Tiempo Real de Webull (NVDA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/options-chain/NVDA?expiration=2026-10-16
x-broker-selection: WEBULL

### 6.6 Cadena de Opciones en Tiempo Real de Alpaca (AAPL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/options-chain/AAPL?expiration=2026-10-16
x-broker-selection: ALPACA

### 6.7 Posiciones Abiertas en Cartera de Webull
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/positions
x-broker-selection: WEBULL

### 6.8 Posiciones Abiertas en Cartera de Alpaca
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/positions
x-broker-selection: ALPACA

### 6.9 Emitir Orden Bursátil Simple en Webull (Compra de 100 Acciones NVDA)
# @name orderWebull
POST {{baseUrl}}/broker/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-broker-selection: WEBULL

{
  "symbol": "NVDA",
  "qty": 100,
  "side": "buy",
  "type": "limit",
  "limitPrice": 221.30,
  "timeInForce": "day"
}

### Variable de ID de Orden Webull
@webullOrderId = {{orderWebull.response.body.order.id}}

### 6.10 Emitir Orden Bursátil Simple en Alpaca (Compra de 100 Acciones AAPL)
# @name orderAlpaca
POST {{baseUrl}}/broker/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-broker-selection: ALPACA

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "qty": 100,
  "side": "buy",
  "type": "limit",
  "limitPrice": 343.85,
  "timeInForce": "day"
}

### Variable de ID de Orden Alpaca
@alpacaOrderId = {{orderAlpaca.response.body.order.id}}

### 6.11 Listar Órdenes en Webull
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/orders
x-broker-selection: WEBULL

### 6.12 Listar Órdenes en Alpaca
GET {{baseUrl}}/broker/orders
x-broker-selection: ALPACA

### 6.13 Cancelar Orden Bursátil en Webull
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/broker/orders/{{webullOrderId}}
x-broker-selection: WEBULL

### 6.14 Cancelar Orden Bursátil en Alpaca
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/broker/orders/{{alpacaOrderId}}
x-broker-selection: ALPACA

### 6.15 Sincronizar Cotización de Broker hacia la Base de Datos
POST {{baseUrl}}/broker/sync-underlying/NVDA
x-broker-selection: WEBULL
x-database-selection: mongodb



